{"architectures":["x64"],"id":"VoiceWave.LocalCore","latestVersion":"0.7.8","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"Free, offline dictation for Windows. Hold Ctrl+Win and talk into any app. Speech runs on-device, with no cloud and no subscription.","license":"Apache-2.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/rithwik1510/VoiceWave-Open-Source-WhisperFlow-Alternative/blob/main/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"Free, offline dictation for Windows. Hold Ctrl+Win and talk into any app. Speech runs on-device, with no cloud and no subscription.","license":"Apache-2.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/rithwik1510/VoiceWave-Open-Source-WhisperFlow-Alternative/blob/main/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"VoiceWave is a free, open-source dictation app for Windows. Hold Ctrl+Win, talk, and the text lands in whatever app you're using, including terminals. Speech is transcribed on your PC with Parakeet (default) or Whisper models, using any GPU through Vulkan or the CPU.\n\n- Local-only transcription (no audio leaves your device)\n- Global hotkey push-to-talk and toggle dictation\n- Say \"press enter\" to submit after the text lands\n- Custom dictionary words for names and jargon\n- Direct insert with clipboard and history fallbacks","moniker":"voicewave","name":"VoiceWave Local Core","packageUrl":"https://github.com/rithwik1510/VoiceWave-Open-Source-WhisperFlow-Alternative","publisher":"Rithwik Posani","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/rithwik1510","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/rithwik1510/VoiceWave-Open-Source-WhisperFlow-Alternative/releases/tag/v0.7.8","tags":["accessibility","dictation","privacy","speech-to-text","transcription","voice","whisper"]}},"longDescription":"VoiceWave is a free, open-source dictation app for Windows. Hold Ctrl+Win, talk, and the text lands in whatever app you're using, including terminals. Speech is transcribed on your PC with Parakeet (default) or Whisper models, using any GPU 